«

@ Create and enter the workspace.
ModuleConstant
Duplicate CreateDirectory
Evaluate


"Constants"
ModuleName Store

@@ Where the module parts are to be found.
"/library/Modules/" ModuleName Add "/" Add
ModulePath Store

@@ Which parts should be loaded and in which order.
{ "GenericFunctions" "Database" }
{ "Menu" } +
{ "Finalise"} +
ModulePartsList Store


@@ Below:
@@ - loading of the parts;


@@ Load a part of the module.
@@ ( <Part name> -- )
«
	ModulePath
	Swap Add ".48s" Add
	Recall Evaluate
»
LoadModulePart Store


@@ Load a list of parts.
@@ ( <List of part names> -- ) 
«
	ReverseList FromList
	@ ( PartN ... Part1 N -- )
	
	1 Swap
	Start
	    LoadModulePart
	Next
»
LoadModulePartList Store


ModulePartsList
LoadModulePartList


